ling into your skin.&nbsp; Another benefit of Botox® is that it’s a quick and easy procedure. It’s a minimally invasive treatment with no downtown that produces almost instant results. You may start noticing an improvement in your skin within just 3 to 4 days and full results within two weeks.&nbsp; Ready to achieve more youthful-looking skin? Visit your local dermani MEDSPA® today ! Why Trust dermani MEDSPA® for your Botox® Cosmetic Injections At dermani MEDSPA®, Botox® Cosmetic is administered by Allergan Certified Medical Doctors, Physician Assistants, and Nurse Practitioners.&nbsp; We are the #1 Botox® Provider in the state of Georgia and a TOP 25 level provider of Botox® in the United States! We contract directly with Allergan, the only manufacturer of Botox® Cosmetic. We were also voted the top medical spa in Atlanta for Botox® and Cosmetic Injectables by Modern Luxury's Jezebel Magazine! Botox® Cosmetic Pricing To help ensure everyone has access to our treatments, we offer affordable Botox® pricing. We offer two pricing options. The first is our monthly membership, designed to help you save big bucks on your skincare regimen. It costs $45 a month, and every penny you spend goes toward your sessions. Our membership pricing for sessions starts at $180 for up to 20 units— additional units over 20 cost $9 per unit.&nbsp; However, we also offer a convenient pay-as-you-go option if you’d prefer to pay only when you receive treatments. A non-membership session is $220 for up to 20 units, and any units over that cost $11 each. Please be aware that prices will vary on location. &nbsp; *Because we want each client to achieve their desired results, we require a minimum of 20 units to secure a Botox® Cosmetic appointment at dermani MEDSPA®.&nbsp; Due to high demand, a $50 deposit is required to schedule.* Botox® Member Pricing Pay-Per-Visit Rates $45 per month. 6 month minimum, no sign up or hidden fees. $9/unit for any units over 20 units per visit. BOTOX® Cosmetic &nbsp; $180 PER SESSION SIGN UP FOR MEMBERSHIP $11/unit for any units over 20 units per visit. BOTOX® Cosmetic &nbsp; $220 PER SESSION Book Now Botox® Member Pricing $45 per month. 6 month minimum, no sign up or hidden fees. $9/unit for any units over 20 units per visit. BOTOX® Cosmetic &nbsp; $180 PER SESSION SIGN UP FOR MEMBERSHIP Pay-Per-Visit Rates $11/unit for any units over 20 units per visit. BOTOX® Cosmetic &nbsp; $220 PER SESSION Book Now Frequently Asked Questions about Botox® Cosmetic Check out our FAQs below to learn more about what to expect from your Botox® treatments at dermani MEDSPA®. Is Botox® Cosmetic safe? Botox® Cosmetic injectables are extremely safe if done by Medical Doctors, Nurse Practitioners, and Physician Assistants like those that inject at dermani MEDSPA®. Our injectors are trained directly by the team at Allergan. How long will the results of Botox® Cosmetic last? Botox® Cosmetic will last approximately 3-4 months until another injection is needed. Results will vary from person to person.&nbsp; Our Botox® Cosmetic membership program is geared to coincide with this timing, offering the best value with no sign up or hidden fees. Simply pay $45/month and every dollar you pay can be used towards Botox® services at the membership rates. What can I expect during my Botox® Cosmetic session? Your Botox® Cosmetic session will last approximately 30 minutes. Your Botox® Cosmetic injection will feel like a slight prick, however our Botox® injectors are highly trained to give you the best experience possible. While you may start to see results after 2-5 days, it typically takes about 1-2 weeks for the full effects of your Botox® Cosmetic injections to completely set in. Will Botox® Cosmetic target my wrinkles? Wrinkles are caused by muscles under the skin contracting. Botox® Cosmetic will relax the muscles in the injected area. Please note that stagnant lines (facial lines that are present without muscle movement) take multiple sessions to treat, so plan on 6-12 months of consistent Botox® Cosmetic injections for optimal improvement in those lines. While your muscles are “under the influence” of Botox® Cosmetic, we highly recommend receiving our Skin Rejuvenation services. This will maximize the effects of your Botox® Cosmetic and give you optimal results.&nbsp; Click here to find out more about our affordable Skin Rejuvenation services! How many units do I need? The amount of units needed is highly customized on a client-by-client basis, depending on the severity of the facial lines, your desired results, etc. We require a FREE consultation before your first appointment so that one of our highly trained injectors can discuss a service plan and units needed with you. To request your free consultation, click here . Can I receive a facial/massage/spray tan/microblading/eyebrow waxing or threading after my Botox® Cosmetic? In order to ensure that your Botox® Cosmetic units set into your muscles correctly, you must wait 1-2 weeks before receiving any of these types of aesthetic services. Are there side effects? Bruising is extremely common and can last up to two weeks after the injection, so make sure to plan your appointment 2-4 weeks before any important events. Short-term side effects of Botox® Cosmetic may include discomfort, bruising, redness, or irritation at the injection site. Some clients experience a mild headache. Make sure to avoid NSAIDS (i.e. ibuprofen), Aspirin (if medically able), alcohol , Vitamin E, and fish oil for 24-72 hours prior to and after injections. For a full list of what to expect from your Botox® Cosmetic appointment, please review our aftercare instructions . Is Botox® Cosmetic preventative? Will it reverse my wrinkles? If Botox® Cosmetic is started at the first signs of aging, it will prevent future lines and wrinkles from setting in with continued service. While Botox® Cosmetic may soften your wrinkles and facial lines over time, it may not completely reverse the fine lines and wrinkles you already have. Will I always need the same dose of Botox® Cosmetic? It is impossible to predict how many units of Botox® Cosmetic you may require in the future based on your current amount of injected units. Like any prescription medication, your dose may increase or decrease based on individual factors Once I begin receiving Botox® Cosmetic, do I have to continue to receive it for the rest of my life? No! You do not have to continue service forever, but if you are looking to achieve optimal results for your future, it is recommended that you make your Botox® Cosmetic appointments a routine. Consistent service will lead to consistent results. Can I receive Botox® Cosmetic while I'm pregnant or breastfeeding? No, individuals that are pregnant or breastfeeding cannot be treated with Botox® Cosmetic. How do I get started? CLICK HERE to schedule your Botox® Cosmetic appointment at one of our multiple convenient locations. These pictures are examples only. &nbsp;Results will vary from person to person. Are You Ready to Glow? Request Your Free Consultation Now! Since 2013, thousands of men and women around the country have transformed their skin (and confidence) with dermani MEDSPA®. Ready to finally look and feel your best? Find a dermani MEDSPA® location near you ! Botox® JUVÉDERM® Skin Rejuvenation Laser Hair Removal Memberships Articles Specials Schedule Online Sitemap 

